0..72 Comment "// Shared access. `access shared c as w { … }` lends a held value to a"
73..150 Comment "// read-only view: the body reads `w` and `c` alike, nothing is written back,"
151..222 Comment "// and the view ends with its body, so it takes no `resume`, `abort` or"
223..295 Comment "// `unwind`. The value is frozen for the body: shared views nest, and an"
296..368 Comment "// exclusive access waits until they end. The loan follows Rust\'s shared"
369..423 Comment "// borrow (_The Rust Reference_, § Borrow operators)."
425..490 Comment "/// A shared view beside its held value: both read the one value."
